  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fact-finding by Swedish Penitentiary &amp; Probation Service Moldova 2021 - Fact-finding assignment conducted by Swedish Penitentiary and Probation Service</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Fact-finding by Swedish Penitentiary &amp; Probation Service Moldova 2021</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a short term feasibility phase type intervention.The main objective is to support the Swedish Probation and Penitentiary Service (SPPS) to develop a project proposal to initiate its cooperation with the Moldovan National Agency of Penitentiary. The feasibility phase will allow SPPS to identify and assess the needs that could be further addressed and to define the terms and conditions for a new project. 

The result expected is a project proposal fully developed and submitted by SPPS to the Embassy in Chisinau by April 2022.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Detta &#xe4;r en kortsiktig genomf&#xf6;rbarhetsfasintervention. Huvudsyftet &#xe4;r att st&#xf6;dja Svenska Kriminalv&#xe5;rden f&#xf6;r att utveckla ett projektf&#xf6;rslag f&#xf6;r att inleda samarbetet med Moldaviska Kriminalv&#xe5;rdsstyrelsen. Genomf&#xf6;rbarhetsfasen g&#xf6;r det m&#xf6;jligt f&#xf6;r Svenska Kriminalv&#xe5;rden att identifiera och bed&#xf6;ma de behov som kan hanteras ytterligare och definiera villkoren f&#xf6;r ett nytt projekt.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a short term feasibility phase type intervention.The main objective is to support the Swedish Probation and Penitentiary Service (SPPS) to develop a project proposal to initiate its cooperation with the Moldovan National Agency of Penitentiary. The feasibility phase will allow SPPS to identify and assess the needs that could be further addressed and to define the terms and conditions for a new project.</narrative>
  </description>
